  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Stockholm Forum on Internet Freedom and Global Development        (SIF)Purpose is to create an international meeting for discussion     regarding internet freedom, and the role a free internet has for      global development. One important aspect of the meeting is to gather  a mixed group of people from low, middle, and high income countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Stockholm Forum on Internet Freedom and Global Development (SIF), Syftet med detta forum &#xe4;r att tillhandah&#xe5;lla ett internationellt      forum som fokuserar p&#xe5; n&#xe4;tets frihet och den roll ett &#xf6;ppet och fritt internet roll f&#xf6;r global utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
